#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là một trong những chiếc màn hình mà Monokuma\n"
"hay xuất hiện.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hiện tại nó chỉ đang hiển thị huy hiệu của trường.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Từ tận đáy lòng, mình thực sự chỉ muốn...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に書類が散らばっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Papers are scattered all over the floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ショーケースだ…
#. トロフィーや盾が飾られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are trophies lining the display case. And even\n"
"some kind of shield...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>立派な本棚だ…
#. 分厚い本やファイルが置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The shelf is lined with files and thick books. The\n"
"shelf is doing its job admirably...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
